ic", "site_admin": false}, "body": "This PR addresses issue #515 \r\nI ran mvn edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:2.1.7:nondex -Dtest=org.everit.json.schema.ObjectSchemaTest#toStringWithUnprocessedProps -DfailIfNoTests=false and notice test failure.\r\n\r\nFor the test: toStringWithUnprocessedProps, the usage of sameJsonAs function, which eventually uses the function deepEqualArrays, enforces strict order of the data in the Json files, making it a potential flaky test.\r\n\r\nThe fix utilizes [JSONAssert](https://github.com/skyscreamer/JSONassert) which compares Jsons but forgive ordering of the data.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2024-10-08T10:23:42Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-23T17:01:41Z", "closed_at": "2024-10-23T17:01:41Z", "merged_at": "2024-10-23T17:01:41Z", "merge_commit_sha": "4d08550b1f2cc7f0e6129b44908eea87bc65909c", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "zhihao11ui:fix-flaky", "ref": "fix-flaky", "repo": {"id": 852076795, "node_id": "R_kgDOMsmo-w", "name": "json-schema", "full_name": "zhihao11ui/json-schema", "owner": {"login": "zhihao11ui", "id": 180229123, "node_id": "U_kgDOCr4UAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180229123?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui", "html_url": "https://github.com/zhihao11ui", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/zhihao11ui/events{/privacy}", "re